<title>USA: Ramsey Cty, Minn., won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Ramsey Cty, Minn., won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said it won $9.275 million of Ramsey Cty, Minn., general obligation capital improvement plan bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.3858 percent.</p>
